G5613.b:
⟪ὡς⟫, adverbial form of the relative pron. ὅς, ἥ, ὅ.
⟪I.⟫ As relat. adv. of manner, ⟪as, like as, just as, even as⟫;
	⟪1.⟫ with a demonstrative, like οὕτως, expressed or understood: οὕτως . . . ὡς, ⟦Mark 4:26|Mk 4:26⟧, ⟦1 Corinthians 3:15|I Co 3:15⟧, ⟦Ephesians 5:28|Eph 5:28⟧, ⟦James 2:12|Ja 2:12⟧, al.; ὡς . . . οὕτως, ⟦Acts 8:32|Ac 8:32⟧, ⟦1 Corinthians 7:17|I Co 7:17⟧, al.; elliptically (sc. οὕτως, οὕτω), c. nom., ⟦Matthew 6:29|Mt 6:29⟧, al.; c. acc., ⟦Matthew 19:19|Mt 19:19⟧, ⟦Mark 12:31|Mk 12:31⟧, al.; c. prep., ⟦Matthew 26:55|Mt 26:55⟧, ⟦Mark 14:48|Mk 14:48⟧, ⟦Luke 22:52|Lk 22:52⟧, ⟦John 7:10|Jo 7:10⟧, al.; c. verb., ⟦John 15:6|Jo 15:6⟧, ⟦2 Corinthians 3:1|II Co 3:1⟧, ⟦Ephesians 2:3|Eph 2:3⟧, ⟦1 Thessalonians 5:6|I Th 5:6⟧, al.; c. ptcp. (the ptcp. however not having the special force wh. it has in cl.; v. Bl., §73, 5; 74, 6), ⟦Matthew 7:29|Mt 7:29⟧, ⟦Mark 1:22|Mk 1:22⟧, ⟦Hebrews 13:17|He 13:17⟧, al.; freq implying opinion or belief, ⟦Romans 9:32|Ro 9:32⟧; so esp, c. gen. absol., ⟦1 Corinthians 4:18|I Co 4:18⟧, ⟦2 Corinthians 5:20|II Co 5:20⟧, ⟦1 Peter 4:12|I Pe 4:12⟧, ⟦2 Peter 1:3|II Pe 1:3⟧.
	⟪2.⟫ Before numerals, ⟪about, nearly⟫: ⟦Mark 5:13|Mk 5:13⟧, ⟦John 1:40|Jo 1:40⟧, ⟦Acts 5:7|Ac 5:7⟧, al.
	⟪3.⟫ Before adjectives and adverbs, ⟪how⟫: ⟦Romans 10:15|Ro 10:15⟧ ⟦Romans 11:33|11:33⟧, ⟦1 Thessalonians 2:10|I Th 2:10⟧; c. superl., ὡς τάχιστα, ⟪as quickly as possible⟫, ⟦Acts 17:15|Ac 17:15⟧.
⟪II.⟫ As conjunction;
	⟪1.⟫ temporal,
		⟪(a)⟫ ⟪as, when, since⟫: ⟦Mark 9:21|Mk 9:21⟧ ⟦Mark 14:72|14:72⟧, ⟦Luke 1:23|Lk 1:23⟧, ⟦John 2:9|Jo 2:9⟧, al.;
		⟪(b)⟫ ⟪while, when, as long as⟫: ⟦Luke 12:58|Lk 12:58⟧, ⟦John 12:36|Jo 12:36⟧, ⟦Galatians 6:10|Ga 6:10⟧ (Field, Notes, 191); ὡς ἄν (M, Pr., 167, and v.s. ἄν), ⟦Romans 15:24|Ro 15:24⟧, ⟦1 Corinthians 11:34|I Co 11:34⟧, ⟦Philippians 2:23|Phl 2:23⟧.
	⟪2.⟫ Final, ⟪in order that⟫; c. inf., ⟪in order to⟫ (M, Pr., 204n), ⟦Luke 9:52|Lk 9:52⟧, ⟦Acts 20:24|Ac 20:24⟧, ⟦Hebrews 7:9|He 7:9⟧.

G5616.b:
⟪ὡσεί⟫ adv.,
⟪(a)⟫ as if, .as it were, like as, like: ⟦Matthew 3:16|Mt 3:16⟧ ⟦Matthew 9:36|9:36⟧, ⟦Acts 2:3|Ac 2:3⟧ ⟦Acts 6:15|6:15⟧, ⟦Romans 6:13|Ro 6:13⟧, ⟦Hebrews 1:12|He 1:12⟧; γίνεσθαι (φαίνεσθαι) ὡσεί, ⟦Mark 9:26|Mk 9:26⟧, ⟦Luke 22:44|Lk 22:44⟧ ([WH] R, mg., om.), ⟦Luke 24:11|Lk 24:11⟧;
⟪(b)⟫ in calculation, and with numbers, about: ⟦Matthew 14:21|Mt 14:21⟧, ⟦Luke 3:23|Lk 3:23⟧ ⟦Luke 9:14|9:14⟧, ⟦Luke 9:28|28⟧ ⟦Luke 22:41|22:41⟧, ⟦Luke 22:59|59⟧ ⟦Luke 23:44|23:44⟧, ⟦Acts 2:41|Ac 2:41⟧ ⟦Acts 10:3|10:3⟧ ⟦Acts 19:7|19:7⟧; ὡσεὶ λίθου βολήν, ⟦Luke 22:41|Lk 22:41⟧.†
